  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Archaeological Mission in Kosovo : from Ulpiana to Iustiniana Secunda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to  increase research and excavation at  the Ulpiana archeological park , and increase the touristic potential of a diverse rural community in Kosovo, while building the country&apos;s scientific capacity and expertise in the treatment, maintenance and enhancement of its archaeological heritage.</narrative>
  </description>
